flowchart LR
  Turnover --> Initial[Initial inspection]
  Initial --> Confirmation[Renter confirmation]
  Confirmation --> Rental
  Rental --> Return[Return inspection]
  Return --> NoIssue[Complete]
  Return --> Claim[Damage claim + evidence]
  Claim --> Response[Participant response]
  Response --> Dispute[Human-reviewed dispute]
  Dispute --> Resolution[Authorized resolution]
  Resolution --> FinanceEffects[Separately controlled deposit/refund effects]
